  "sourceTitle": "Clams Casino",
  "sourceText": "Clams Casino\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, December 26, 2009 - 12:17am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 8 oz. cans chopped clams reserve juice\n1 can reserved clam juice\n1/2 cup chopped onions\n1 clove garlic, minced or powder\n1/2 cup chopped green pepper\n1/2 teaspoon Tabasco sauce\n1 cup bread crumbs\n1/4 cup melted butter\n1/2 cup diced bacon bits\n1 tablespoon lemon juice\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix ingredients well; loosely fill clean clam shells with mixture.  2 Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese.  3 Bake at 350 degrees approximately 20 minutes.",
